  "important_notice_heading": "Important Notice – Yonoapp Dex",
  "important_notice": "<h2><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9L1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 17h.01\"/></svg>Important Notice</h2>\n<p>Please take note of the following key points regarding YonoappDex and the games listed on our platform:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>No Connection with SBI:</strong> YonoappDex is an entirely independent information directory. We have <strong>no connection, partnership, or affiliation</strong> with State Bank of India (SBI), the official YONO banking app, or any bank or financial service whatsoever.</li>\n  <li><strong>No Real-Money Games:</strong> We strictly list free-to-play games that use virtual coins, chips, or points with no cash value. We do not feature or endorse any apps involving real-money deposits, betting, or cash withdrawals.</li>\n  <li><strong>No File Hosting:</strong> We do not host, store, or distribute APK files. All download links direct users strictly to official app stores or verified developer websites.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>If you encounter any app claiming to be connected to us, offering cash payouts, or misrepresenting our directory, please report it immediately via the <strong>Report this game</strong> button or write to our Grievance Officer, <strong>Govardhan Das</strong>, at <a href=\"mailto:support@yonoappdex.com\">support@yonoappdex.com</a>.</p>\n<p><em>Last updated: 3 November 2026</em></p>\n",
  "report_removal_meta_title": "Report and Removal Policy",
  "privacy_meta_description": "Read the YonoappDex privacy policy. We do not use accounts or ad trackers. Learn how basic visit data and user reports are handled under India's DPDP Act, 2023.",
